  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) ÷ and +**\n\n→ 11 × 12 + **78 ÷ 6** – 57 = 88\n\n→ **11 × 12** + 13 – 57 = 88\n\n→ **132 + 13** – 57 = 88\n\n→ 145 – 57 = 88\n\n→ 88 = 88\n\n→ **LHS = RHS **→ **Satisfies the equation**\n\n**2) × and +**\n\n→ 11 + **12 ÷ 78** × 6 – 57 = 88\n\n→ 11 + **2/13 ×**** 6** – 57 = 88\n\n→ **11 + 12/13** – 57 = 88\n\n→ 155/13 – 57 = 88\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**3) ÷ and –**\n\n→ 11 × 12 - 78 + **6 ÷ 57** = 88\n\n→ **11 × 12** - 78 + 6/57 = 88\n\n→ **132 -**** 78** + 6/57 = 88\n\n→ 54 + 6/57 = 88\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**4) – and ×**\n\n→ 11 – **12 ÷ 78** + 6 × 57 = 88\n\n→ 11 – 2/13 + **6 ****×**** 57** = 88\n\n→ **11** – 2/13 **+ 342** = 88\n\n→ 353 – 2/13 = 88\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 1 satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****÷ and +\"**.",
